:: eyebrow ::
AI writes a great deck. It just looks awful.

:: title ::
Slides AI can finally [design.]{.grad-hero}

:: tagline ::
Bring an idea. AI designs it. slaide makes it look like you.

:: meta ::
Web · PDF · PowerPoint · one file

:: visual ::
