---
layout: problem
footer: "AI designs it. slaide makes it yours."
---
:: eyebrow ::
01 · The problem

:: head ::
AI is a brilliant writer. And a [terrible designer.]{.red}

:: sub ::
Ask it for a deck and you get clashing fonts, walls of text, and charts that don't show up.

So you lose the evening fixing slides by hand. Again.

:: code ::
[Q3 Strategy Overview]{.lg .bold}

[a synergy roadmap deck]{.muted}

