---
layout: concept
footer: "AI designs it. slaide makes it yours."
---
:: eyebrow ::
02 · The fix

:: head ::
AI can design. It just needs a [system.]{.grad}

:: body ::
Your fonts, your colors, your layouts — defined once, in slaide. AI designs every slide inside that system, so the deck comes out polished and on-brand, not generic.

Open it on the **web**, send a crisp **PDF**, or keep editing in **PowerPoint**. One file, every format.

:: preview ::
```echart
title:
  text: Built to win the quarter
  subtext: Quarterly run-rate · indexed to Q1
  left: 2
  top: 2
  textStyle: { color: "#15120E", fontFamily: "IBM Plex Sans", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700 }
  subtextStyle: { color: "#6B6358", fontFamily: "JetBrains Mono", fontSize: 18 }
tooltip: { trigger: axis }
grid: { left: 6, right: 20, top: 104, bottom: 26, containLabel: true }
xAxis:
  type: category
  boundaryGap: false
  data: ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"]
  axisLabel: { color: "#6B6358", fontSize: 18, fontFamily: "JetBrains Mono" }
  axisLine: { lineStyle: { color: "#E0D6C5" } }
  axisTick: { show: false }
yAxis:
  type: value
  axisLabel: { color: "#6B6358", fontSize: 15 }
  splitLine: { lineStyle: { color: "#ECE3D4" } }
series:
  - name: Run-rate
    type: line
    smooth: true
    symbol: circle
    symbolSize: 13
    lineStyle: { width: 6 }
    label: { show: true, position: top, color: "#15120E", fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700 }
    areaStyle: { opacity: 0.18 }
    data: [100, 142, 198, 270]
```

